ChillarPay Case Study

ChillarPay is a fictional UPI payment application based in Jaipur.

It has 8 lakh users and receives around 2,000 customer support messages daily in English and Hinglish.

The support team has 6 members and faces difficulty handling all customer complaints.

Objective: To test whether AI can classify customer messages, set priorities and prepare suitable replies.

Support Categories

1. Failed Payment
2. Refund
3. Fraud Alert
4. Account & KYC

Priority Rules

* High: Money lost without permission or account blocked.
* Medium: Money stuck, delayed payment or refund pending.
* Low: General information or profile update.

Reply Rules

* Keep replies polite and short.
* Use the customer’s first name if provided.
* Never promise a refund date.
* Reply in Hinglish if the customer writes in Hinglish.
